        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/e274bd/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-03-05T20:38:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Okay thank you!</p>\n<p>Another question, so if I have an ongoing power that can be used for damage, like Tempest’s hurricane, and put it in play, is that also the power I use that round?</p>\n<p>When my next turn comes and I have a power to play, is the ongoing hurricane the power I must use?  Or can I not use it that round and use a different power, but keep the hurricane in play?</p>\n<p>Thank you for your help!</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:00:11.205Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
