        "created_at": "2012-03-05T21:18:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Any card you play that has a “Power” section simply adds to the list of available powers you can use.  There is no obligation to use the power on a card you just played, and there is no obligation to use powers at all.</p>",
